<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mixed at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was down one basis-point at 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			  March 14 fix	  March 13 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	   3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	   3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	   3.07 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	   3.16 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	   3.26 pct		3.25 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	  3.36 pct		3.35 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
